      "message": "When extracting media_codecs_diwali_v2.xml from ziyi blobs, the file only contains a set of \u003cInclude\u003e references:\n```\nmedia_codecs_system_default.xml\nmedia_codecs_dolby_audio.xml\nmedia_codecs_with_dolby_taro.xml\nmedia_codecs_with_dolby_diwali.xml\nmedia_codecs_with_dolby_cape.xml\n```\n\nTherefore, when the device variant is set to _diwali_v2 (vendor.media.target_variant\u003d_diwali_v2), it is required to also extract media_codecs_system_default.xml.\n\nWithout this file, the codec configuration remains incomplete and media codecs will fail to initialize properly.",
